            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The classics just never go out of style - I did however use a bit less orange juice. I chilled the glass and used crushed ice - YUM!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BrightLemon6620"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I use 6 Oz oj, 2 shot glasses tequila, and 1/2 Oz grenadine. It's more of a make to taste type drink. And to get a better sunrise effect, hold a spoon against the inside of the glass and pour the grenadine over the spoon. DO NOT STIR THE DRINK....Give the grenadine time to settle. Best drink ever.",
            "datePublished": "2025-01-08T00:10:35.222Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SpiffyMango4284"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I gave this recipe a five star rating. This is a cocktail that I have wanted to try for years, but have never taken the time to try and make one. The flavor was great. It was very refreshing, and I really liked it. Instead of orange juice I used a Sparkling Ice Starburst Orange, adjusted the amount of tequila and Grenadine and it came out perfect. That’s one thing about cocktails, you can create them to suit your taste and to give you the flavor you’re looking for. This is definitely one to keep.",
            "datePublished": "2024-07-07T17:46:07.195Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Derek Zomonski"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I gave this a 4 because there was a little too much grenadine. I dropped the amount for my taste to 0.5oz and it was great though I have to admit my orange juice was sweet and that could have accounted for the need to drop the grenadine.",
            "datePublished": "2021-04-26T20:37:27.370Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
